# Build context for media-actor-image-publish.yml is `tools/`. Keep it tiny:
# package*.json are COPYd explicitly for the cached npm ci layer; everything
# heavy or host-specific is excluded. (Only the media-actor image builds from a
# tools/ context; the demo-recorder image uses its own tools/demo-recorder/.)
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
# Recorded artifacts / scratch
**/*.webm
**/*.mp4
**/out
**/output
**/dist
# VCS / editor / CI noise
.git
.gitignore
**/.github
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
